OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions linger over Value
OL,4,AJersey's use of consultants
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Jersey's June election, six seats
OL,7,Fwere won by candidates endorsing Value
OL,8,FJersey. The group is not a registered
OL,9,Fpolitical party, but a policy-focused
OL,10,Fmovement, meaning it is not subject to
OL,11,Fexisting rules on election expenses.
OL,12,FCandidates published their election
OL,13,Fexpenses in August but despite these
OL,14,Fdeclarations some questions remain over
OL,15,Fhow much Value Jersey paid political
OL,16,Fconsultancy The Messina Group. Value
OL,17,FJersey said it "followed the law"
OL,18,Fthroughout the process.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
