OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions linger over Value
OL,4,AJersey's use of consultants
OL,5,
OL,6,FValue Jersey was one of the biggest
OL,7,Fsuccess stories of Jersey's election
OL,8,Fdespite not even being on the ballot
OL,9,Fpaper.
OL,11,FThe political movement had a manifesto
OL,12,Fand provided campaign support to
OL,13,Fcandidates who supported their
OL,14,Fpolicies. It was not a registered
OL,15,Fpolitical party.
OL,17,FThe group had a commercial contract
OL,18,Fwith a political consultancy, The
OL,19,FMessina Group, to advise on its
OL,20,Felection strategy and messaging.
